WEBVTT

00:12.410 --> 00:13.990
Hey, Sora! Wait!

00:13.990 --> 00:15.850
Sora!

00:19.300 --> 00:20.620
Hey, Sora!

00:20.950 --> 00:23.850
I'm telling you to wait for me!

00:34.430 --> 00:36.640
You're full of energy today, Sora.

00:39.940 --> 00:42.260
What will I do with you?

00:43.650 --> 00:47.610
<i>Sora changed after healing Ciel's wounds?</i>

00:48.280 --> 00:51.300
<i>"He ate the wounds and evolved"?</i>

00:52.200 --> 00:53.880
Evolved?

00:53.880 --> 00:55.660
What does "evolved" mean?

00:56.010 --> 01:00.660
It's true that Sora loves blue potions, 
the ones that heal wounds, but...

01:02.740 --> 01:03.920
Sora!

01:06.300 --> 01:08.340
What is it?

01:13.490 --> 01:16.350
It looks like the nonoshi have been 
digging up yamamo over there.

01:16.350 --> 01:19.050
And over such a wide area!

01:20.070 --> 01:22.870
Just how big are these nonoshi?

01:24.400 --> 01:27.020
Someone, help me!

01:27.020 --> 01:29.280
No!

01:30.540 --> 01:31.610
Wha?

01:32.090 --> 01:33.110
Huh?

01:41.410 --> 01:43.000
Ciel!

01:47.010 --> 01:51.520
Oh, Ciel! You scared me! Honestly!

01:54.720 --> 01:58.180
Don't worry. I love you, too, Sora!

02:02.000 --> 02:04.130
I love both of you!

02:07.320 --> 02:11.460
<i>When I'm alone, I can breathe</i>

02:11.460 --> 02:15.620
<i>In a world with no one 
but me, I feel at ease</i>

02:16.280 --> 02:20.640
<i>But I think the truth is</i>

02:20.640 --> 02:26.620
<i>That I've been waiting for 
morning's light to break through</i>

02:24.120 --> 02:32.380
<b>The Weakest Tamer
Began a Journey
to Pick Up Trash</b>

02:24.280 --> 02:26.620
<i>(Where could it be?)</i>

02:26.620 --> 02:29.870
<i>Beyond the edges of a yet unknown map</i>

02:29.870 --> 02:34.130
<i>That's where I'll find a place 
where I can live</i>

02:32.380 --> 02:34.130
<i>(If it exists...)</i>

02:34.130 --> 02:36.140
<i>I'd like to go there</i>

02:36.140 --> 02:39.890
<i>And with trembling legs, 
I take a step forward</i>

02:39.890 --> 02:42.480
<i>I'm on a journey without end</i>

02:42.480 --> 02:44.790
<i>And even if I carry nothing with me</i>

02:44.790 --> 02:46.940
<i>I'll take everything I feel</i>

02:46.940 --> 02:48.900
<i>And pack it into my once empty bag</i>

02:48.900 --> 02:50.720
<i>I'll go as far as I need to</i>

02:50.720 --> 02:52.940
<i>On this journey to find myself</i>

02:52.940 --> 02:55.030
<i>And everything I'm given along the way</i>

02:55.030 --> 02:59.490
<i>Will slowly fill my heart to the brim</i>

03:09.360 --> 03:13.720
<i>Now, I'm not all alone anymore</i>

03:13.720 --> 03:18.640
<i>Because I've met new, dear friends</i>

03:18.640 --> 03:23.390
<i>(Maybe we can understand each other 
because we're alike. Isn't it strange?)</i>

03:23.390 --> 03:26.600
<i>Your bright laughter gives me courage</i>

03:26.600 --> 03:30.860
<i>(I feel like I'm wrapped up 
snugly by your warmth)</i>

03:30.860 --> 03:36.110
<i>From now on, let's stay 
together forever and ever</i>

03:36.990 --> 03:41.990
<b>On a Path
to Adventure</b>

03:52.250 --> 03:56.870
It's so good!

03:59.760 --> 04:05.310
Since you caught so many wild 
rabbits, it was easy to make dinner!

04:05.760 --> 04:07.890
Thank you, Ciel!

04:10.580 --> 04:12.690
Sora, you eat lots, too!

04:17.170 --> 04:18.900
Tomorrow, I'll wake up early...

04:19.220 --> 04:22.500
and then I have to go check 
the field mouse traps.

04:32.410 --> 04:34.550
Do you think there'll be any field mice?

04:36.740 --> 04:37.720
Not here.

04:37.720 --> 04:39.170
Or here.

04:39.170 --> 04:41.140
Not here either!

04:41.140 --> 04:44.180
What bad luck. Looks like we came up empty.

04:45.100 --> 04:48.430
Well, we still have some meat 
left over from last night,

04:48.430 --> 04:50.650
so I suppose I'll use that for breakfast!

04:53.650 --> 04:55.860
What is this presence?

04:59.150 --> 05:01.570
I feel a strange presence.

05:01.970 --> 05:04.350
What could it be?

05:04.350 --> 05:05.290
Sora!

05:10.020 --> 05:11.370
It's chasing us!

05:11.370 --> 05:13.000
What is this presence?

05:13.000 --> 05:15.500
It's making me really sick!

05:36.830 --> 05:37.990
Wait...

05:38.320 --> 05:40.140
It isn't a monster?

05:40.510 --> 05:41.730
A human?

05:42.490 --> 05:45.060
No! Don't come any closer!

05:50.370 --> 05:51.910
Ciel?

05:56.030 --> 05:57.460
The presence...

05:57.460 --> 05:59.100
disappeared?

05:59.770 --> 06:02.550
What... was that?

06:12.600 --> 06:15.750
Yes, this is comfortable.

06:15.750 --> 06:17.590
Thank you, Ciel!

06:17.590 --> 06:19.950
You saved me earlier, too!

06:22.000 --> 06:24.210
Still, that thing earlier...

06:24.940 --> 06:27.720
What could that have been?

06:28.520 --> 06:31.810
It was a really unpleasant presence.

06:32.910 --> 06:34.270
Ciel?

06:36.750 --> 06:38.810
What's wrong, Ciel?

06:42.960 --> 06:44.260
An ogre!

06:44.260 --> 06:46.010
What's it doing here?

06:48.950 --> 06:50.430
Oww.

06:50.930 --> 06:52.210
Ciel?

06:56.150 --> 06:57.440
There's one up here, too!

06:57.440 --> 06:58.680
Sora!

07:13.000 --> 07:15.410
Ciel!

07:17.290 --> 07:18.790
It can't be.

07:29.790 --> 07:31.930
No!

07:39.860 --> 07:40.990
What is all this?

07:43.460 --> 07:45.280
There are so many.

07:46.640 --> 07:48.740
What could this possibly...

07:53.450 --> 07:54.530
They're here!

08:12.910 --> 08:15.520
What is this? What is this thing?

08:15.520 --> 08:17.910
Is this a trap?

08:18.840 --> 08:21.480
No! Wait!

08:31.360 --> 08:35.580
Flame Attack!

08:50.250 --> 08:51.770
Did you see that?

08:51.770 --> 08:54.600
That firestorm assault belongs 
to me, Lattrua!

08:54.600 --> 08:55.350
Huh?

08:57.180 --> 08:59.730
Hot! It's hot!

08:59.730 --> 09:01.190
Hot! Hot! Hot!

09:01.190 --> 09:02.850
Why is there a child in the trap?

09:02.850 --> 09:05.190
I don't know!

09:05.190 --> 09:08.030
Seriously... When will you learn?

09:08.800 --> 09:11.070
Hold back a little, you moron!

09:15.120 --> 09:16.370
Wait, hang on!

09:24.240 --> 09:25.780
Made it just in time.

09:26.210 --> 09:30.660
Still, why is a child like you...

09:39.450 --> 09:42.050
What? Slimes?

09:42.480 --> 09:45.180
Quite the mess you've gotten 
yourself into, Lattrua.

09:45.180 --> 09:47.270
Thanks for the help, Meela.

09:49.250 --> 09:50.650
Lastal! Leedel!

09:55.200 --> 09:59.200
I'd expect no less of the Blazing Sword,
star of the suppression squads.

10:07.480 --> 10:08.720
Are you all right?

10:08.720 --> 10:10.710
You still can't close out a fight, Lattrua!

10:10.710 --> 10:13.550
Seyzelk, Nouga...

10:13.550 --> 10:15.640
I was a little surprised, that's all.

10:15.640 --> 10:17.050
B-Behind you!

10:28.400 --> 10:30.480
Shifale. Impressive, as usual.

10:30.480 --> 10:34.070
Honestly. Given the results,
 was there any point to making the trap?

10:34.070 --> 10:38.370
Well, you know, 
we did get rid of them safely.

10:38.370 --> 10:39.950
That pathetic logic is no excuse.

10:39.950 --> 10:41.950
Now, don't say that.

10:45.110 --> 10:47.090
Suppression squad?

10:47.750 --> 10:48.850
That's right.

10:48.850 --> 10:53.590
We've heard that lots of monsters like those 
ogres earlier have settled in this area.

10:53.590 --> 10:58.730
We've been sent here to hunt down
 those monsters. Hence, "suppression squad."

10:59.060 --> 11:03.230
Then, that trap was meant to trap an ogre?

11:03.230 --> 11:04.660
Exactly.

11:04.660 --> 11:08.550
Although, since he suddenly turned 
everything into a sea of flames,

11:08.550 --> 11:10.430
it was a wasted effort.

11:10.430 --> 11:14.710
Well, since one got caught in the trap, 
I just thought, "This is it!"

11:15.550 --> 11:18.240
I'm so sorry that I didn't 
realize what was going on!

11:18.730 --> 11:21.160
More importantly, lad, you're not hurt?

11:21.160 --> 11:24.220
N-No, sir! I'm all right.

11:24.220 --> 11:28.500
Thank you so much for saving me! Um...

11:28.500 --> 11:32.710
We're a group of adventurers
called the Blazing Sword.

11:33.060 --> 11:35.850
I'm the leader, Seyzelk.

11:35.850 --> 11:36.930
I'm Nouga.

11:37.290 --> 11:39.930
I'm Shifale. Pleased to meet you.

11:39.930 --> 11:43.830
And I'm Lattrua. Nice to meet you!

11:44.420 --> 11:48.410
And over there, that's Meela 
of the Green Gale.

11:48.410 --> 11:49.830
She's a friend of mine.

11:50.480 --> 11:52.440
I'm Meela. Nice to meet you.

11:52.810 --> 11:57.950
M-My name is Ivy! I'm honored 
to make your acquaintance!

12:10.000 --> 12:12.500
Our campsite is at the foot of this hill.

12:13.090 --> 12:14.770
Will you be able to walk that far?

12:14.770 --> 12:16.010
I'll be all right!

12:16.570 --> 12:21.390
By the way, Ivy, what were you doing 
all the way out here in the mountains?

12:21.390 --> 12:25.980
Well, I was on my way to Otolwa 
from Latome Village,

12:25.980 --> 12:27.520
and then I was chased by ogres.

12:27.860 --> 12:30.150
From Latome Village?

12:30.150 --> 12:31.980
By yourself?

12:31.980 --> 12:33.460
Y-Yes.

12:33.910 --> 12:37.030
We came from Otolwa.

12:37.470 --> 12:40.990
There are still monsters wandering 
this area, so it's dangerous.

12:41.660 --> 12:45.200
If you're headed to Otolwa, 
then you should travel with us.

12:45.780 --> 12:48.160
Really? That would help me so much!

12:48.430 --> 12:51.390
Helping travelers is part 
of the suppression squad's duties.

12:51.390 --> 12:52.730
Don't let it trouble you.

12:52.730 --> 12:53.750
Yes, sir!

12:56.800 --> 12:58.970
That's this suppression squad's campsite.

12:59.720 --> 13:04.620
We say that, but other adventurer 
groups have gathered there, too.

13:05.140 --> 13:06.720
It's incredible.

13:06.720 --> 13:07.570
Let's go.

13:14.020 --> 13:15.520
Ciel!

13:15.520 --> 13:19.380
You're safe! I'm so glad!

13:21.920 --> 13:26.490
<i>But if anyone finds her now, 
Ciel will be hunted down, too.</i>

13:26.490 --> 13:29.690
<i>Ciel! Don't come over here!</i>

13:29.690 --> 13:32.460
<i>Hide! Please! Over that way!</i>

13:35.210 --> 13:38.440
<i>Ciel! That way! That way!</i>

13:39.700 --> 13:42.130
<i>I wonder if she understood.</i>

13:42.130 --> 13:44.390
Ivy, is something wrong?

13:44.390 --> 13:46.600
It's this way! Over here!

13:47.040 --> 13:49.220
Oh! Yes!

13:49.780 --> 13:51.710
I'm coming!

13:59.230 --> 14:02.950
Adventurer groups have gathered 
from many other places.

14:03.860 --> 14:06.780
So, this place has to grow bigger 
to accommodate them.

14:08.610 --> 14:11.350
We've left monster repellant 
around the perimeter,

14:11.350 --> 14:13.260
so there's no fear of being attacked.

14:14.320 --> 14:17.500
This is ours, the tent of the Blazing Sword.

14:17.860 --> 14:20.630
The plot next to ours is vacant. 
Use it as you like.

14:20.630 --> 14:21.460
Yes, sir!

14:21.460 --> 14:23.720
Then, this is where I leave you.

14:24.260 --> 14:25.480
Thanks for the help!

14:25.480 --> 14:26.180
Of course!

14:26.180 --> 14:31.140
Now, then. We're going to a meeting 
about the next steps in our monster hunt.

14:31.530 --> 14:35.130
If there's anything you 
don't understand, ask Lattrua.

14:35.130 --> 14:36.860
Lattrua, we'll leave it to you.

14:37.500 --> 14:39.180
See you when you get back!

14:39.180 --> 14:40.320
Bye.

14:46.850 --> 14:48.700
Cooking duty?

14:48.700 --> 14:52.980
That's right... but I'm no good at cooking.

14:52.980 --> 14:55.120
I always try really hard to cook something,

14:55.120 --> 14:57.850
but they say things like, 
"This tastes strange,"

14:57.850 --> 15:00.960
or "This is too gamey," 
and get angry with me.

15:00.960 --> 15:05.100
And now I'm scared to cook.

15:06.180 --> 15:09.600
What kind of dishes do you usually make?

15:09.960 --> 15:14.560
Despite how I may appear, 
I have a three-star flame attack skill!

15:15.280 --> 15:17.190
I grill! I roast!

15:17.680 --> 15:19.110
I torch everything in sight!

15:20.280 --> 15:22.070
And I season it with salt and pepper.

15:24.440 --> 15:28.990
So, Ivy, won't you please 
help me get dinner ready?

15:28.990 --> 15:32.550
All right. Let's make it together.

15:33.940 --> 15:37.120
For the wild rabbit meat, we can 
use herbs to remove the gaminess

15:37.120 --> 15:39.380
and rub them in with some salt for seasoning.

15:39.890 --> 15:42.840
Then, cut it into bite-sized pieces 
and quickly sauté it.

15:43.520 --> 15:46.890
Cut up the vegetables and stew 
them in a pot with the meat.

15:46.890 --> 15:49.580
Add some herbs here, too, 
for aroma and flavor.

15:49.580 --> 15:52.630
Then, let's take this mou meat, 
add some mildly spicy herbs,

15:52.630 --> 15:54.420
and fry until nice and browned.

15:54.770 --> 15:57.020
Incredible.

15:58.320 --> 16:00.020
Sorry to keep you waiting!

16:00.440 --> 16:02.730
I hope it suits your tastes.

16:10.410 --> 16:12.160
Let's have some, then.

16:12.590 --> 16:14.120
Thank you for this meal.

16:18.800 --> 16:20.880
U-Um...

16:21.700 --> 16:24.590
Is it not to your liking?

16:24.590 --> 16:26.180
It's great!

16:27.420 --> 16:30.220
What is this? It's so good!

16:30.220 --> 16:33.470
It's wild rabbit, but there 
isn't even a hint of gaminess.

16:33.470 --> 16:37.280
This aroma... I didn't know 
food could be cooked this way.

16:37.860 --> 16:41.420
Um, when you cook foods together 
with nice-smelling leaves at high heat,

16:41.420 --> 16:43.980
it helps to remove the gaminess from meats.

16:44.740 --> 16:48.240
<i>I wonder if people in this area 
don't know about herbs.</i>

16:50.160 --> 16:52.240
My, what a lovely smell!

16:52.880 --> 16:56.010
To think that the Blazing Sword 
would be eating a decent meal.

16:56.420 --> 16:58.460
What brought this on?

16:58.460 --> 17:00.540
You've come at the perfect time!

17:00.880 --> 17:04.380
Look at this! Ivy made this for us!

17:04.380 --> 17:06.480
It looks delicious!

17:07.340 --> 17:10.420
There's plenty here. 
Will you have some, Meela?

17:10.420 --> 17:11.940
Yes, thank you for offering!

17:14.890 --> 17:17.900
Oh! This is delicious!

17:17.900 --> 17:18.850
Isn't it?

17:19.170 --> 17:23.700
It's perfectly cooked. 
It's aromatic. It's truly delicious!

17:24.490 --> 17:25.690
Isn't it, Nouga?

17:27.550 --> 17:30.650
We understand how you feel. 
Now, calm down, all right?

17:31.120 --> 17:33.620
I'm so glad you're pleased with it!

17:33.980 --> 17:38.830
Since Lattrua had cooking duty, 
I was worried about our dinner tonight,

17:38.830 --> 17:41.420
but thanks to you, we have a delicious—

17:42.020 --> 17:44.080
Lattrua! You...

17:44.440 --> 17:47.550
Did you make Ivy cook all of this food?

17:47.550 --> 17:50.380
Huh? No, I, um...

17:50.380 --> 17:53.590
He didn't! We made it together!

17:53.590 --> 17:57.680
Mister Lattrua expertly adjusted 
the heat of the fire for me.

17:58.070 --> 17:59.810
That's why it all turned out so well!

17:59.810 --> 18:01.420
That's right!

18:01.420 --> 18:04.270
Manipulating fire is my forte, after all!

18:04.270 --> 18:06.200
Just like this!

18:12.740 --> 18:14.740
<i>It's just like fireworks!</i>

18:15.940 --> 18:19.970
<i>Fireworks. Flame color reactions 
and metallic elements.</i>

18:21.960 --> 18:25.170
What is it? Ivy, what's wrong?

18:25.170 --> 18:28.040
Oh, it's nothing.

18:28.420 --> 18:31.630
I was just thinking that 
if you had more varieties of metal,

18:31.630 --> 18:35.180
you'd be able to make even more 
beautiful flames, that's all.

18:35.180 --> 18:38.680
Metals? I have those.

18:41.020 --> 18:44.140
They're broken weapons 
and pieces of other equipment.

18:44.140 --> 18:49.090
Iron, copper, tin, decorative stones... 
There are all sorts of things.

18:49.550 --> 18:52.110
But what will you do 
with these bits and pieces?

18:52.110 --> 18:54.070
Well, for example...

18:54.940 --> 18:59.630
If we take this decorative stone and 
add this wild rabbit bone and some salt...

19:00.660 --> 19:03.560
then tie it all together like this...

19:04.260 --> 19:09.290
Mister Lattrua, can you shoot these upwards 
and burn them the way you did just now?

19:09.290 --> 19:12.260
Yes, I can, but...

19:22.460 --> 19:24.000
What is that?

19:24.000 --> 19:26.310
Now, this one! And this and this!

19:51.880 --> 19:54.340
I ate so much!

19:54.870 --> 19:56.420
Please leave those over there.

19:56.420 --> 19:57.300
No.

19:57.920 --> 20:00.260
Ivy, please go and relax.

20:00.770 --> 20:03.470
You made all that delicious food for us.

20:04.000 --> 20:06.230
We'll handle the clean up.

20:06.230 --> 20:08.690
No! I'll clean, too!

20:09.050 --> 20:13.420
I got to feast thanks to you! And I want to 
thank you for saving me from the ogres.

20:13.420 --> 20:14.910
Please let me do this!

20:15.320 --> 20:18.360
I see. Then, how about we clean up together?

20:18.720 --> 20:19.820
Yes, sir!

20:22.530 --> 20:25.250
Y-You're so adorable!

20:25.250 --> 20:28.210
I want a little brother like this!

20:36.550 --> 20:38.680
Sorry I'm so late, Sora.

20:39.050 --> 20:40.950
Here's your dinner.

20:44.350 --> 20:47.400
It's already late, so keep quiet, all right?

20:53.480 --> 20:56.530
Today was challenging 
in all sorts of ways, wasn't it?

20:56.530 --> 21:00.500
And those people... I was surprised at first.

21:01.060 --> 21:03.520
I'm so glad they turned out 
to be good people.

21:05.570 --> 21:07.210
Good night, Sora.

21:11.530 --> 21:16.860
He's still so small. To think 
he's traveled all this way alone.

21:17.500 --> 21:21.780
It seemed like he hasn't been 
eating well. He's too thin.

21:22.180 --> 21:25.140
That child is too considerate of others.

21:25.580 --> 21:28.280
That anxious look he gave me 
when I told him to rest...

21:29.230 --> 21:33.600
and his happy expression when 
I asked him to help clean...

21:33.600 --> 21:39.700
It's as if he has it in his head that 
if he isn't useful, he'll be cast aside.

21:40.530 --> 21:44.250
Though, there isn't really 
anything we can do about it.

22:11.090 --> 22:14.680
<i>You are not alone</i>

22:14.680 --> 22:18.240
<i>Open your eyes</i>

22:18.240 --> 22:20.030
<i>That’s the way</i>

22:20.030 --> 22:24.730
<i>You’ll be fine</i>

22:24.730 --> 22:28.810
<i>All of us are here now</i>

22:28.810 --> 22:34.630
<i>You’re something special</i>

22:34.630 --> 22:41.900
<i>Please just relax, and move forward</i>

22:42.890 --> 22:47.310
<i>Because you are here now</i>

22:47.310 --> 22:52.170
<i>The world is so beautiful</i>

22:52.170 --> 22:57.920
<i>This place is full of light</i>

22:57.920 --> 23:04.540
<i>You had countless nights of tears</i>

23:04.540 --> 23:11.930
<i>But you walked all the way here</i>

23:11.930 --> 23:18.250
<i>If it’s dark we’ll be your light</i>

23:18.250 --> 23:28.080
<i>You see the end of this road 
is crystal clear</i>
